{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばちは\n最近お休みがあると一日中寝てしまいます。24時間中22.5時間はベッドにいます。いくらでも寝れちゃうんです。不思議。\n秋だからかな🍠\n佐々木久美です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日はTGC北九州でした！なんと、Special Cllectionで、全体の2番目を歩かせていただきました🥺"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364N1392F3BP4DDWQ7X3Q5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n衣装もメイクも可愛い🥺とっても緊張しました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも私のお隣に、、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364P0QC07HW9RRCGY7BCBW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46の梅澤美波さんがいらっしゃって、たくさんお話ししました💗💗とっても優しくて美しくて緊張が解けました🥺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364Q14JTYFYRZ1171QBCHW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　ライブもさせて戴きました！\n応援しにきてくださった方々、ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして日曜日は大阪城ホールでMBS音祭に参加させていただきました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364R157PXYDH0EA0485FFJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364S1XAHHST6Q4B4NPTGJ3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バウムクーヘンにたこ焼き！新大阪駅では必ず歌います。大阪LOVER！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364T2EG5QEHVTZYFRMBJBB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364V1H7QGVF73B6G88T2WY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364W266N4GZ5ZM9JS7K5RE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364X4D2NFK404BWEM9RYW2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nめいちゃんたくさん！新衣装は秋色です🍠"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MBS音祭、とても楽しかったです🥺おひさまパワー感じました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は「うたコン」に出演させていただきます！「こん好き？」チェックチェックです👌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ364Y4WB0RTA5P3APSVP191","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ暑い〜🌞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}